      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You are adept at flying in tight spaces or underground, or through narrow crevices where walls are ever present and use them for protection. As long as you are within 15 feet of a surface, ceiling or wall when you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.cS9nfDRGD83bNU1p]{Fly}, you can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.ust1jJSCZQUhBZIz]{Take Cover} at the end of your movement. Even if the surface is not a feature that allows you to do so, you still benefit from lesser cover.</span></p>"
